 dogs are like children… maybe the opposite is also true, right? The misunderstanding will turn into a fun and engaging journey, and through laughter and challenges, both Pasquale and the children will learn the true values of friendship, respect, and vulnerability"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A94UmmZnfVG6G2wJuWldNVP9NJt.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zxGqjCtODAyL0k5CALhscgqEBwm.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1134789,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A94UmmZnfVG6G2wJuWldNVP9NJt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A94UmmZnfVG6G2wJuWldNVP9NJt.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/A94UmmZnfVG6G2wJuWldNVP9NJt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/A94UmmZnfVG6G2wJuWldNVP9NJt.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sfwC7zakgyIevrXb3EzUs1Wnwv1.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/sfwC7zakgyIevrXb3EzUs1Wnwv1.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mnxbOlIzWtdeVkX1cCxheNwvVpV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mnxbOlIzWtdeVkX1cCxheNwvVpV.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mnxbOlIzWtdeVkX1cCxheNwvVpV.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mnxbOlIzWtdeVkX1cCxheNwvVpV.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"xx":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]}},"background":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k7CoESuduPgX